 "notes": "Content plan (pair 27 trial, catacomb kit): a small one-floor crypt for levels 300-400, the undead gap between the Bonechoir Catacomb (200-290) and the Ossuary Stair (400-520). Eight zones (O337: two cloisters added, 132 x 110, 2.3 -> about 3.8 monsters per 100 and a sweep over 45 s): a loop through the two ossuaries, the weeping cloister and the sepulchre hall to the sexton nave, the boss ring past it; the Hollow Rider holds the ring at the south end. With ChaosAssetsArt.PAIR27 on, the catacomb kit's sarcophagi, crypt hatches and portal ring join the decoration (areaplan/decor_assets_art.json)."
